00:03:28.941 --> 00:03:32.478
WILL HAVE TO ADJUST POLICY ON
ABORTION AND MESSAGE FOR 2024.

00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:39.919
&gt;&gt; YOU CAN NEVER ASK PEOPLE TO
ADJUST THEIR POLICIES BASED ON

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:42.221
ELECTIONS.
SOMETIMES PRINCIPLES, SOMETIMES

00:03:42.221 --> 00:03:43.523
PRINCIPLES ARE MORE IMPORTANT.
YOU HAVE TO CONVINCE THE

00:03:43.523 --> 00:03:46.559
AMERICAN PEOPLE EVEN IF THEY
DISAGREE WITH YOU ON THEIR

00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:48.861
PRINCIPLE YOU'RE WORTHY OF THEIR
SUPPORT.

00:03:48.861 --> 00:03:52.031
SO I CHALLENGE CHANGING THEIR
POSITION.

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:55.234
THAT SAID THEY HAVE TO ACCEPT IF
THEY'RE GOING TO BE THAT STRICT

00:03:55.234 --> 00:03:59.038
ON ABORTION, THEY'RE GOING TO
TURN OFF YOUNGER VOTERS WHICH

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:02.608
VOTED OVERWHELMINGLY DEMOCRAT.
AND THEY'RE GOING TO TURN OFF

00:04:02.608 --> 00:04:03.543
WOMEN.
WHICH VOTED SIGNIFICANTLY

00:04:03.543 --> 00:04:08.314
DEMOCRATIC.
AND THAT'S THE WAY IT IS.

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:12.185
THERE ARE TIMES YOU DON'T FOLLOW
THE POLLS.

00:04:12.185 --> 00:04:15.388
THERE ARE TIMES YOU LOOK PEOPLE
STRAIGHT IN THE EYE AND SAY

00:04:15.388 --> 00:04:17.657
ENOUGH.
I HEAR YOU, I KNOW WHERE YOU

00:04:17.657 --> 00:04:22.295
